<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41031" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιστίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>mark with spots on the surface, speckle</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				332
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νῶτον ἱμάσθλῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					37.410
				</span></i>
			 (s.v.l.):—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be spotted</i> or <i>speckled</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				3.7.5
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ νώτῳ οἱ σημεῖα ἐπέστικται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>NA</u>
					11.24
				</span></i>
			; <i>to be marked with a dot</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ἐπεστιγμένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aen.Tact.
					31.29
				</span></i>
			.—In Moer.and <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιστίζω, -στιγμα</span>, are
			for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπι-σίζω, -σιγμα</span>.</div>
